    "title": "Seven Carroll seniors sign for college - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Glenn Marini ,\n1 hours ago\nFORT WAYNE, Ind. (WANE) – Seven Carroll High School seniors made their college choice official on Wednesday afternoon with Lily George (basketball/Huntington University), Ava Myers (basketball/Bethel University), Carter Irons (baseball & football/Trine University), Patrick Cain (baseball/Manchester University), Jayce Richards (baseball/Glen Oaks CC), Eli Ledger (baseball/Glen Oaks CC), and Jack Johnson (baseball/Glen Oaks CC) all putting pen to paper.\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WANE 15.",
